WEBVTT

00:11:28.339 --> 00:11:30.430
multi-celled organisms appear.

00:11:30.454 --> 00:11:32.955
You get fungi, you get fish,

00:11:32.979 --> 00:11:34.494
you get plants,

00:11:34.518 --> 00:11:37.229
you get amphibia, you get reptiles,

00:11:37.253 --> 00:11:39.683
and then, of course,
you get the dinosaurs.

00:11:40.739 --> 00:11:43.248
And occasionally, there are disasters.

00:11:44.326 --> 00:11:46.715
Sixty-five million years ago,

00:11:46.739 --> 00:11:48.703
an asteroid landed on Earth

00:11:48.727 --> 00:11:50.517
near the Yucatan Peninsula,

00:11:50.541 --> 00:11:53.509
creating conditions equivalent
to those of a nuclear war,

00:11:53.533 --> 00:11:55.422
and the dinosaurs were wiped out.

00:11:55.906 --> 00:11:58.976
Terrible news for the dinosaurs,

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.755
but great news
for our mammalian ancestors,